{"articleNo":"80171","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=view&articleNo=80171&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"대학생활의 이해 특강 안내(3월 25일)","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2013.03.20","hit":"12632","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><!--StartFragment--> </p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">우리 대학 학생들에게 대학의 자긍심과 애교심을 고취하고 종합적인 인성능력의 함양을 위한 특강을 아래와 같이 개최하오니 학생들의 많은 청강 바랍니다.</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">- 강연자 : 최종열(탐험가)</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">- 주&nbsp; 제 : <font color=\"#008299\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"></span></font><font color=\"#0900ff\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><strong style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\">“창조와 개척의 리더십”</strong></span></font></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">- 일&nbsp; 시 : 2013년 3월 25일 14시-16시</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">- 장&nbsp; 소 : 글로벌관 시청각실(GB109호)</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">- 수강대상 : 수강신청자 및 청강 희망자</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">-&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">kit인재인증제도 점수 부여</span></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"></p><table style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"1\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.4pt double\" valign=\"center\" width=\"219\" height=\"36\"><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">구분</span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.4pt double\" valign=\"center\" width=\"170\" height=\"36\"><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">점수 부여</span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.4pt double\" valign=\"center\" width=\"170\" height=\"36\"><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">비고</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.4pt double; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"center\" width=\"219\" height=\"52\"><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">수강신청자</span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.4pt double; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"center\" width=\"170\" height=\"52\"><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">15점(필수)</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">-과목이수시-</span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.4pt double; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.1pt solid\" valign=\"center\" width=\"170\" height=\"88\" rowspan=\"2\"><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">참사람분야</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.1pt solid\" valign=\"center\" width=\"219\" height=\"36\"><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">청강자(비수강 신청자)</span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.1pt solid\" valign=\"center\" width=\"170\" height=\"36\"><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">2점(선택)</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '한컴바탕'\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">&lt;강연자 약력&gt;</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt\">- 1987년 동계 에베레스트 등반</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt\">- 1989년 한국 최초 자북점 도달</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt\">- 1991년 한국 최초 북극점 도달</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt\">- 1993년 시베리아 베링해 탐험</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt\">- 1996년 세계 최초 사하라 사막 도보횡단 성공</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt\">- 2000년 한국최초 실크로드 자전거횡단 성공</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt\">- 2002년 한국최초 아프리카 밀림적도 대탐험</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt\">- 2010년 한국최초 대한민국 해양대탐험 성공</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><strong><font color=\"#0900ff\">* 수강신청하지 않은 학생들의 청강을 환영합니다.&nbsp; </font></strong></span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
